{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49780","headline":"浣溪沙 九 · 张泌","name":"浣溪沙 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小市东门欲雪天，衆中依约见神仙，蘂黄香画贴金蝉。\n饮散黄昏人草草，醉容无语立门前，马嘶尘烘一街烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}